# MaCSad board workspace

Import BoardDraft from "./board_draft.lg".
Import BoardHealth from "./board_health.lg".
Import BoardLanes from "./board_lanes.lg".

The board composes local draft, read-only connection, and policy-backed lanes.
The policy outcomes arrive from the application root as inputs.

## Component BoardWorkspace (columnCount: Int) and (closedWorkAccepted: Bool)
View:
    <section>
      <div class="page-head"><div>
        <p class="kicker">Process control / six states</p>
        <span class="sr-only">The board has {columnCount} phases.</span>
        <h1>Research work, made navigable.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Browse the research process and prepare a local draft. Example cards below are not saved cases.</p>
      </div><BoardHealth/></div>
      <BoardDraft/>
      <BoardLanes closedWorkAccepted={closedWorkAccepted}/>
    </section>
Style:
    .page-head { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .page-head > div { flex: 1 1 320px; }
    .kicker { margin: 0 0 9px; color: #146878; font: 800 11px/1 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0,0,0,0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }
    h1 { margin: 0; color: #102c3b; font: 750 clamp(30px,4vw,48px)/1.04 Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
    .lede { max-width: 680px; margin: 12px 0 0; color: #59666d; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; }
